# Ars Magica Definitive Edition, Houses of Hermes: True Lineages — House Tremere (Lore)

**Version:** 0.5.0
**Source:** Houses of Hermes: True Lineages (Atlas Games) — Ars Magica Fifth Edition, Chapter Four (pp. 110–143) and the Appendix (p. 144)
**Publisher:** Atlas Games

> Chapter Four’s narrative, verbatim: the House’s symbols, its history, its condition in 1220 and
> its internal structure, plus the book’s closing Timeline. The chapter’s mechanics are structured
> records elsewhere — promotion, specialist roles and the Certamen styles in
> `armdef-houses-true-lineages-0.5-tremere.ttrpg`, the new spells in `…-0.5-tremere-spells.ttrpg`,
> the new Virtues in `…-0.5-tremere-virtues.ttrpg`, the summoned creatures in
> `…-0.5-tremere-bestiary.ttrpg`, the sidebars in `…-0.5-tremere-sidebars.ttrpg`. The House itself
> is the canonical `^"House Tremere"` DEF in `armdef-0.5-houses.ttrpg`.

